Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:25:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] dt-bindings: input: apple,dockchannel-hid: add the
 T6050 compatible

apple,t6050-dockchannel-hid selects the MTP receive ring, as
apple,t6041-dockchannel-hid does for the M4 Pro. A board that uses it lists
the second DART stream in iommus.

Signed-off-by: Joshua Warren <816217+joshuaswarren@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit 52bc8b1017416d27f9a507aad434e03f6c5815f7)
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml      | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml
index 78849612f1..cd04a9228e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/apple,dockchannel-hid.yaml
@@ -32,7 +32,9 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - const: apple,dockchannel-hid
       - items:
-          - const: apple,t6041-dockchannel-hid
+          - enum:
+              - apple,t6041-dockchannel-hid
+              - apple,t6050-dockchannel-hid
           - const: apple,dockchannel-hid
 
   reg:
